2026-10-30T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2346) 'How the project was placed, and what is still open
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2346  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2346) 'decider-pong is a manifest row on the interactor side, tracking `main`. Its upstream, `Mapika/decider` (Apache-2.0), is a second row beside it, pinned to a commit. It was a git submodule; it is not any more. Both are in the local mirror, and a fresh offline client syncs them with 0 failures. The OpenBao credential helper was removed from the tree.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2346  1 LINE
 Text:Written

